  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using pca_n2000 RNA encoder and avgpool aggregation with weighted fusion (e.g., config_041) achieve high accuracy (0.639). This experiment tests scvi_n200 RNA encoder with similar settings (avgpool, weighted fusion) but on a cheaper image encoder (imagenet_vit_l), which may offer a better cost-accuracy trade-off. It clarifies whether scvi_n200 outperforms pca_n2000 while keeping costs lower than config_041 (estimated 7.02 GPU hours vs. 10.60). This balances exploration (RNA encoder variation) and exploitation (similar effective architecture)."
}

